e": "2560 1440.png", "id": "1077341404090196", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75540508_1077341407423529_4511965539534469614_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S7svCghyRkgQ7kNvwFn7UJd&_nc_oc=Adoqa_bkq0LTlD3L2U5XNo4GOezCcmlhd2UCAe35p0yEeUucp7Jm5kwsT38JOEc0RTo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR26-JVG8bHfhrITptL1WqQXBWw_-boHMnecFzi_9q0-A&oe=6B0DC4CB"}, "display_name": "POLYBLOCS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=43-FrPU8h4kQ7kNvwHNOLQ-&_nc_oc=AdpPDQnTDMqW9c-5HvEUJB7tJc1r7ATuWchainfexL0RbojFFSg0W4X2-pZkteLq93U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQnmxpONj2bAxyBKh3812AvyhII_JHj6FF4N0A6y7Kpuw&oe=6B0DB849"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc